  "title": "Get car details"
 },
 "description": "Use this when the user asks for more about one specific car returned by search_cars (engine power, body, colour, price history, how long it has been listed). Requires the car id from search_cars; do not guess ids. Returns technical data and the AutoIsto price verdict; it does not return the seller's name, phone, description, VIN or licence plate \u2014 for contact the user opens the car's url. If the car is no longer in the offer, found is false.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
